# Documentation Assessment Report

Created: July 30, 2026

Project: Documentation Portfolio

Related Document: Documentation Improvement Plan

---

## Purpose

This report documents the findings of the Documentation Audit conducted during Day 2 of the Documentation Improvement Project.

The purpose of this audit is to evaluate the current state of the documentation portfolio, identify strengths, document areas for improvement, and prioritize future work. No documentation changes are made during this phase. Findings from this report will guide implementation throughout the remainder of the project.

---

## Audit Scope

The following pages were reviewed during the documentation audit:

- Landing Page
- Documentation Homepage
- LoveLitReviews Quick Start Guide
- Currency Exchange Quick Start Guide
- PokeAPI Quick Start Guide
- PokeAPI Reference
- Contact Page

---

## Audit Methodology

Each page is evaluated using the following criteria:

- Purpose
- Strengths
- Areas for Improvement
- Priority
- Audit Notes

The audit focuses on:

- Content quality
- Organization
- Information architecture
- Navigation
- User experience
- Visual communication
- Writing quality
- Accessibility
- Overall professionalism

