## Landing Page (`/`)

### Purpose

The landing page successfully introduces the documentation portfolio and provides visitors with an entry point to the documentation collection. It establishes a professional first impression and serves as the primary entry point for recruiters, hiring managers, and other visitors.

### Strengths

- Professional and modern visual design.
- Clean and uncluttered layout.
- Consistent branding and styling.
- Clear navigation to documentation.
- Responsive design.
- Fast page load.
- Strong first impression.

### Areas for Improvement

- The portfolio purpose could be communicated more prominently.
- The author's professional role and expertise could be introduced earlier.
- The value proposition could be be more immediately apparent to first-time visitors.
- Featured documentation projects could be emphasized more clearly.
- Opportunities exist to better showcase technical writing skills and documentation specialties.

### Priority

High

### Audit Notes

No major usability or functionality issues were identified.

The page provides a strong foundation for the portfolio. Most opportunities for improvement relate to messaging, content presentation, and highlighting professional experience rather than layout or functionality.

